lychee for Debian
-----------------

This package ships no configuration file. lychee runs with built-in defaults
and reads lychee.toml from the working directory, or whatever --config names.

An annotated example is installed at

  /usr/share/doc/lychee/examples/lychee.example.toml

Copy it to lychee.toml beside the files you are checking, or pass it with
--config. Nothing is placed in /etc: a file there would be a dpkg conffile,
prompted about on upgrade, for a program that does not look there.

 -- pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>
